Third-party references
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The v2 report buildout (docs/REPORT-BUILDOUT-PLAN.md and starter/report/*) is informed by
two MIT-licensed community solutions. Feature sets, page taxonomy, and historical-trending
approach were used as design references. Any adapted source retains the original MIT terms;
where a page or measure was built clean-room from the documented behavior, attribution is
recorded here as good practice.

1. RuiRomano/pbigtwmonitor — On-Premises Data Gateway monitor (MIT License)
   https://github.com/RuiRomano/pbigtwmonitor
   Referenced for: operator report page taxonomy (Logs, Queries, Gateway Profile, Counters,
   Requests, Mashups Profiles, Mashups Logs) and NumberDays/SinceDate historical trending.

2. GT-Analytics/fuam-basic — Fabric Unified Admin Monitoring, basic (MIT License)
   https://github.com/GT-Analytics/fuam-basic
   Referenced for: holistic overview-report/landing pattern, DirectLake-over-Delta serving,
   and notebook-based one-click deployment approach.

If actual source files from either project are vendored into this repository, the full text
of the corresponding MIT LICENSE must be added alongside them and listed here.
